## Sales Listing [/sales_listings/{id}]

+ Parameters
    + id (required, integer, `217`)

### Update a Sales Listing [PATCH]

This endpoint can be used to set sales listing's website URL or set Internet Hits value.

Do not hotlink image URLs in your applications. These URLs may change at any time, and we do
not support third-party implementations using our bandwidth. Always fetch image URLs through 
the API as intended.

**Accepted parameters:**
  - url `(String)`
  - internet_hits `(String)`

If any of the permitted parameters is omited in request payload - the corresponding value will not be changed on the backend.

*Note that as `id` attribute one of `id` or `uniqueId` can be used to update sales listing's attributes.*

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

    + Body
    
            {
                "sales_listing": {
                    "url": "https://example.com/path/to/listing",
                    "internet_hits": "1000"
                }
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {}

