# Group Contacts

**Attributes:**
- id `(Number)`
- first_name `(String)`
- last_name `(String)`
- mobile `(String)`
- email `(String)`
- permit\_email_campaign `(Boolean)`
- permit_sms `(Boolean)`
- ealert\_enabled `(Boolean)` - *equals `true` when the contact has ealerts enabled for at least one set of buying criteria*
- consultant\_id `(Number)` - *equals Consultant ID with "My Contact" category. If there is no such category assigned, then the contact creator will be returned*
- address `(Object)` - *residential Property address*
  - unit `(String)`
  - number `(String)`
  - street_name `(String)`
  - street_type `(String)`
  - suburb `(String)`
  - postcode `(String)`
  - state `(String)`
  - country `(String)`
  - latitude `(Number)`
  - longitude `(Number)`
- categories `(Array of Object)`
  - name `(String)`
  - consultant_id `(Number)`
  - type_id `(Number)`
- comments `(Array of Object)`
  - id `(Number)`
  - consultant_id `(Number)`
  - important `(Boolean)`
  - created\_at `(String)` - *in ISO 8601 format*
  - updated\_at `(String)` - *in ISO 8601 format*
  - text `(String)`
- criteria `(Array of Object)` - *buying criteria*
  - id `(Number)`
  - type `(String)` - *can be `rental` or `sales`*
  - suburb_ids `(Array of Number)`
  - property\_type\_ids `(Array of Number)`
  - property\_category\_ids `(Array of Number)`
  - ealert_enabled `(Boolean)`
  - beds_from `(Number)`
  - beds_to `(Number)`
  - baths `(Number)`
