### Update a Contact [PATCH]

This endpoint can be used to permit/deny email campaigns subscription and create notes on contact's timeline when contact details like firstname, lastname, email or mobile has changed for an existing contact.

*Note that the `consultant_id` attribute is optional and should only be used when the website user makes
an enquiry about a specific listing or contacts a specific consultant. This will grant the consultant access
to the contact in the CRM.*

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

    + Body
    
            {
                "contact": {
                    "first_name": "John",
                    "last_name": "Doe",
                    "permit_email_campaign": true,
                    "permit_sms": true,
                    "mobile": "+61555999888",
                    "email": null,
                    "consultant_id": 5
                }
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {}

# Group Contact Categories

## Contact Category Types [/contact_category_types{?expand}{&after}]

Depending on parameter `expand` returns list of all available Category Types in the system as array of names or array of objects.

### Get simple list of Category Names [GET /contact_category_types]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "My Contact", "Web Enquiry"
            ]

### Get expanded list of Category Types [GET /contact_category_types{?expand}{&after}]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Parameters

    + expand (required, boolean, `true`) ... Return expanded list

    + after (optional, string, `1520452907_37`) ... Paging cursor returned in the last response

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "data": [
                    {
                        "id": 1,
                        "name": "My Contact",
                        "office_group_id": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 2,
                        "name": "Web Enquiry",
                        "office_group_id": 1
                    }
                ],
                "paging": {
                    "next": "https://your-domain.boxdice.com.au/website_api/contact_category_types?after=1520848432_2&expand=true"
                }
            }

## Contact Categories collection [/contacts/{contact_id}/categories]

### Assign contact categories [POST]

This endpoint can be used to assign one or more contact categories to a contact.
Categories should already exist in the system.

+ Parameters

    + contact_id (required, integer, `12`) ... Contact ID

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

    + Body

            {
                "categories": [
                    {"name": "My Contact", "consultant_id": 1},
                    {"name": "Web Enquiry", "consultant_id": 2}
                ]
            }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {}

### Remove contact categories [DELETE]

This endpoint can be used to remove (unassign) one or more contact categories from a contact.

+ Parameters

    + contact_id (required, integer, `12`) ... Contact ID

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06
            
    + Body

            {
                "categories": [
                    {"name": "Web Enquiry", "consultant_id": 2}
                ]
            }

+ Response 204 (application/json)

