## Suburbs Collection [/suburbs{?after}]

+ Parameters

    + after (optional, string, `1520452907_37`) ... Paging cursor returned in the last response

### Retrieve all suburbs [GET]

This endpoint allows the caller to retrieve a collection of suburbs.
Because the overall number of records is large, the API only returns a limited set of suburbs.
It also provides a URL the caller can use to fetch the next batch of suburbs. This process
can continue until the response is empty.

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {
                "data": [
                    {
                        "id": 13,
                        "name": "Barkers Creek",
                        "postcode": "3451"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 157,
                        "name": "Erigolia",
                        "postcode": "2669"
                    }
                ],
                "paging": {
                    "next": "https://your-domain.boxdice.com.au/website_api/suburbs?after=1520452907_2669"
                }
            }

