## Offices collection [/offices{?after}]

### List all offices [GET]

The response contains paginated list of offices the Api-Key is authorized to access. 

The Office collection returns `bdm_consultant_id`, which can be used as the default `consultant_id` when creating BDM leads using Add Lead Flow Lead endpoint (listing_type: 'rental')."

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Parameters

    + after (optional, string, `1520452907_37`) ... Paging cursor returned in the last response

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "name": "Smith Woodend",
                    "company_name": "Smith Real Estate",
                    "street_address": "1/23 Peterson Street",
                    "suburb": "Woodend",
                    "state": "VIC",
                    "postcode": "3442",
                    "phone": "0312345678",
                    "fax": "0312345679",
                    "email": "smith.woodend@example.com",
                    "bdm_consultant_id": 2
                }
            ],
            "paging": {
                "next": "https://your-domain.boxdice.com.au/website_api/offices?after=1520848432_1"
            }

        }
        
